\"acfba66\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b3eae8 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0b3eae8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Radiant Warmer (P-001A)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-310d507 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"310d507\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h5><ol><li>It is microprocessor-based servo-controlled unit that will allow at least two operation modes-servo (automatic) and manual mode.<\/li><li>The radiant warmer has a heating element with power consumption of 800-1200 Watts.<\/li><li>It has quartz \/ non-ceramic infrared \/ Ceramic Heater heating element with parabolic stainless-steel reflector for uniform radiation of heat waves to all corners of the basinet.<\/li><li>Heater is protected by a metal grid to prevent shock hazards.<\/li><li>The heater box \/ head will be either of swivel type and it must rotate to \u00b190\u00ba from its axis or fixed type head provided it allows X-Ray exposure from top.<\/li><li>It has LED display (at least 1&#8221;) for showing skin temperature in manual mode and set and skin temperatures in servo mode. Temperature display should be bright, numerical.<\/li><li>The unit has a rechargeable battery backup (30 min. or more) for display of temperatures &amp; alarm during power failure.<\/li><li>It has an adjustable light source (LED) for observation of the baby.<\/li><li>Probe : Skin and Air Probe.<\/li><li><strong>The Basinet :<\/strong>\u00a0(A) Comprises of foldable \/ dropdown transparent acrylic \/ poly carbonate side panels of minimum 6mm in thickness and can be swiveled easily for cleaning and procedures. (B) It will not be fixed with the warmer ; if it is fixed them it detachable easily for cleaning purpose. Both move on locked wheels. (C) It has one fixed transparent acrylic sheet below mattress for under surface phototherapy and an additional acrylic tray with basinet for positioning the X-Ray cassette. (D) The unit has facility for inclination in both directions (trendelenburg and reverse trendelenburg) minimum up to 12\u00ba. (E) Stitch-less mattress supplied with a foam density of 21-25 kg\/m3 with at least 1 inch in thickness. (F) Mattress cover will be made of fire-ratardent material. (G) Mattress are waterproof and easily washable. It should be resistant to cleaning chlorine-based solution.<\/li><li><strong>Dimensions :<\/strong> (A) Probe length : Not less than 3 ft. (Skin and Air Probe). (B) Length of basinet : Minimum 680 mm. Width of basinet : Minimum 50 mm. (C) Working level from the ground up to upper level of the mattress : Minimum 870 mm. (D) Distance from mattress top and heat source : Minimum 850 mm. (E) Diameter of castors for Radiant Warmer and Basinet with brakes\/locks on front wheels : Minimum 75 mm. (F) The unit be supplied with 2 (two) drawers and 1 (one) IV stand. The minimum diameter of IV stand (Stainless Steel) will be 2.5 cm with 4 pages (stainless steel) for hanging IV fluids.<\/li><li>Height adjustment system for Radiant Warmer and Basinet is accommodated : \u00b1 2 inch.<\/li><li>Monitor tray (to be supplied with) : 30 mm x 270 mm.<\/li><li>Operating temperature range : 10\u00baC to 30\u00baC or wider.<\/li><li>Operating humidity range : 30%-90% RH.<\/li><li>Skin temperature range : 32\u00baC to 38\u00baC, Accuracy : \u00b10.2\u00baC, Resolution : 0.1\u00baC accorlade.<\/li><li>Alarm for Probe failure, Heat failure, High and Low Temperature, Power failure.<\/li><li>Electrical supply : Power I\/P to be 180-240 VAC, 50Hz fitted with Indian 3 pin plug.<\/li><li>UPS of suitable rating with voltage regulation and spike protection for 60 Minutes backup.<\/li><li>Accessories &amp; Consumables to be supplied with the machine : (A) Mattress : 02 (two). (B) Temp. (skin) and Air Probe (Reusable) : 02 Each (two). (C) Fuse set : 01 (one). (D) Monitor tray : 01 (one).<\/li><li>Documents \/ Certification :- European CE &amp; ISO 13485.<\/li><li>User \/ Technical \/ Maintenance Manual to be supplied in English \/ Hindi.<\/li><li>Cleaning and maintenance of Radiant Warmer and Basinet is user friendly.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd6de04 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bd6de04\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Description<\/h4><p><strong>RADIANT WARMER<\/strong> is an electrically powered device with a radiant heating source intended to maintain the thermal balance of an infant by radiation of energy in the infrared region of the electromagnetic spectrum.<\/p><p><strong>RADIANT WARMER<\/strong> is a microprocessor controlled unit which heater placed on the over head panel. This work n both servo and manual mode options to maintain the baby temperature at the set value. There was two modes of operation manual and baby (servo) mode. It has displays reading the set and baby observed temperatures separately.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f6f8e2 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5f6f8e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Technical Specification<\/strong><\/p><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"64\" height=\"20\">Power Requirement<\/td><td width=\"64\">220 to 240V, 50Hz<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Power Consumption<\/td><td>&lt;800 Watt<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Sound Level<\/td><td>&gt;65dBA at 3 mtrs.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a825edf flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-thegem-styledbutton\" data-id=\"a825edf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;thegem_button_skin&quot;:&quot;outline&quot;,&quot;add_icon&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"thegem-styledbutton.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\